        "answer": {
          "short": "$5, 7, 9$",
          "worked": "Shape 1 has 3 orange tiles and 2 blue tiles, so $y = 5$.\nEach new shape adds a column of 2 blue tiles:\nFor $x = 2$, $y = 5 + 2 = 7$.\nFor $x = 3$, $y = 7 + 2 = 9$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 20
      },
