        "id": "v2-flow-section-23-slot-19-slot-19-q-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "Determine an equation that relates the two quantities.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$y = 2x + 3$",
          "worked": "The rate of change is $m = 2$ tiles per shape.\nWhen $x = 0$, $c = 5 - 2(1) = 3$.\nTherefore, the linear equation is $y = 2x + 3$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 35
      },
      {
        "id": "v2-flow-section-23-slot-19-slot-19-q-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "Use your equation to determine the number of tiles in shape 25.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$53$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}y&=2x+3\\\\&=2(25)+3\\\\&=53\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
